{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And he took her for a harlot.</b> Because she was sitting at a crossroads." "<b>For she had covered her face.</b> He could not see her and recognize her. And our Sages' midrash — <b>for she had covered her face</b>: when she was in her father-in-law's house she was modest; therefore he did not suspect her."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:36.532279931Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}